# Local-only annotation source. Manifested in config/data_manifest.tsv and
# pinned by sha256 -- exactly like the RDS above -- but never committed:
# xl/sharedStrings.xml carries the lab's own cell-source codes and a collection
# date, and this repository has a shared GitHub remote and an external-bundle
# export path (scripts/make_chatgpt_results_bundle.sh copies config/, context/,
# docs/ and input_tables/). Only opaque repository-local donor-group labels plus
# source-cell coordinates are committed; the crosswalk deliberately does not
# exist here. See config/source_contract.yaml local_only_verification.
#
# Accepted consequence: a clone without this file cannot pass
# check_data_manifest.py --check-hashes. Already true for the RDS above.
# Path is NFC -- an editor normalizing it to NFD silently stops matching.
data/secreción proteinas ADOC anotaciones.xlsx

# Local editor settings, not part of the project contract.
.vscode/
